# raw snapshots + big generated datasets stay out of git (regenerable / reference gitignored data)
data/*
out/*
# ...but track the small code-required / deliverable text artifacts (own-line comments; git has no inline):
# - column_contract.tsv: the enumerated 1281-code contract that build_dataset.py reads
# - extraction_report.md: the banked validation report
# - deferred_codes.tsv: the on-demand enrichment shopping list
!data/column_contract.tsv
!out/extraction_report.md
!out/deferred_codes.tsv
